<title>ROMANIA: PRESS DIGEST - ROMANIA - APRIL 2.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - ROMANIA - APRIL 2.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Here are highlights of stories in Romania's press on Wednesday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy:</p>
<p>Business:</p>
<p>ADEVARUL</p>
<p>- The farm ministry decided to launch an investigation into alleged irregularities at the horse farm in Mangalia.</p>
<p>- Japan will give Romania a $177 million credit to support economic reforms.</p>
<p>- Heavy rainfalls over the past days affected road and rail traffic.</p>
<p>- Romania's big trade unions announced plans for labour protests.</p>
</text>
